<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Kolosus says talks off.</title>
<headline>Kolosus says talks off.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food group Kolosus Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday that talks first announced in September had been terminated.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
